{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:38:00+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:38:00+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Georg Fischer AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"Switzerland","city":"Schaffhausen","website":"https://www.georgfischer.com","employees":13030,"summary":"Georg Fischer AG engages in the provision of piping systems, and casting and machining solutions in the Americas, Asia-Pacific, Europe, Middle East, Africa, and internationally. The company operates through GF Industry and Infrastructure Flow Solutions and GF Building Flow Solutions. The GF Industry and Infrastructure Flow Solutions segment focuses on leak-free piping systems, fittings, valves, pipes, automation, fabrication, and jointing technologies. It serves a wide range of industries, including microelectronics, chemical processing, water, marine, data centers, food and beverage, energy and life sciences. The GF Building Flow Solutions segment offers safe drinking water systems, energy-efficient radiant heating and cooling systems, and infrastructure solutions used for increasing productivity in conserving, managing, and providing water indoor climate solutions for the residential and commercial construction, municipality, and utilities sectors. The company was founded in 1802 and is headquartered in Schaffhausen, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Georg Fischer AG fournit des systèmes de tuyauterie et des solutions de moulage et d'usinage dans les Amériques, en Asie-Pacifique, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique et à l'international. La société opère par le biais de GF Industry and Infrastructure Flow Solutions et de GF Building Flow Solutions. Le segment GF Industry and Infrastructure Flow Solutions se concentre sur les systèmes de tuyauterie, les raccords, les vannes, les tuyaux,